{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "combo-s-nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# 玩家普攻｜结构图\nPlayerCombo持有原激活内的段序、输入请求和Task／窗口／移动资源。\nASC持有原请求与终止认证；Animation提供Montage／姿态契约；CMC唯一执行胶囊位移；Combat查询并去重命中。\n[[计划_玩家普攻连段|连段说明]] · [[AbilitySystem/结构|GAS结构]] · [[GGYGO_流程_玩家普攻连段.canvas|连段流程]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 1510,
      "height": 190,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-ga",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## UGGYGOPlayerComboAbility\n持有原Activation、段序／请求号、FStepMotionResources、输入Task与Owned窗口。\nInitializeAbilityActivation／ActivateAbilityBody：原激活与原生参数→初始化并执行本GA。\nStartStep(Original,Index,Position,RequestId)：原激活与配置段→该段的播放／移动资源。\nHandleMontageNotify／HandleInputPressed：原作者点事实／SourceStep和RequestId→本段的打断与接续决策。\nCleanupAbilityResourcesForTermination(Context)：原终止上下文→归还本GA资源。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|基类生命周期接口]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-config",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## FGGYGOComboStep[] / 正式GA\n配置Montage、Main/End、MotionSlotName/Scale、InterruptionNotifyName、NextStepIndex、Rate、Damage/Poise与TraceShape。\n每Montage的作者点使用唯一精确stock原生Montage Notify；正式GA的NextStepIndex为1/2/0。\nValidateComboConfiguration：段配置→必需来源、作者点链接／时间／唯一性的有效结果或诊断。\nNextStepIndex=INDEX_NONE表示该段没有攻击接续。\nInputBufferSeconds为保留的序列化字段，不参与输入缓存。",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 340,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-task",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Montage Task / WaitComboInput\nCombo持原Task/native token；输入Task给真实SourceStep/RequestId，不存GA门。\nConfigureOriginalMontageNotify：preReady固定唯一原点；ResolveOriginalMontageNotify校验配置。\nNotifyReceived(FGGYGOMontageNotifyFact)：原Montage/Mesh/实例ID/名称/作者TriggerTime；可交付原自然blend。\nTryGetOriginalMontageNotifySnapshot：原点与实际位置；Section另有原快照/事实，无dt游标。\nTask持原Playback/Guard/scale/Ticket/订阅，精确退自身资源；Required历史OnFailed与普通回调保持。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构|Task契约]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Animation Source / Required Pose / CMC\nBuildSourceBindingRange冻结原Main→End连续来源；CMC BeginMontageActionMotion / native RMS唯一执行XYZ胶囊。\nQuery/SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent发布原Scope真实资格；CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement只退原Handle。\nNotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut许可原有限尾区间；ObserveMontageActionMotionCompletion发布末贡献消费事实。\nActionPoseSlot保留Body−Trajectory−MeshRef全XYZ姿态余量；Guard/节点求值归Animation，Task只持Ticket。\n[[Animation/动作姿态修正|姿态执行]] · [[Movement/结构|移动契约]]",
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-network",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 强类型纠正与完成接口\nFGGYGOComboCorrectionData由Combo定义，包含段／位置／窗口／Revision；ASC只按Spec/key路由TargetData。\nReceiveAbilityCorrection：强类型载荷→本段纠正；Combo负责类型、范围及Revision校验。\nCurrentStepRequestId属于当前段请求，按请求号区分新旧接受，段序允许03→01。\nRequestAbilityEnd／Cancel：固定Original→原终止结果。\nGA结束数据、ASC本地通知与TerminationCompletedNotice分别描述各自生命周期边界。\n[[AbilitySystem/结构#原请求终止|完成接口与权限]]",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1230,
      "width": 650,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 输入请求接口\nIA_Attack配置Pressed；ASC活跃Spec的InputPressed由WaitComboInput消费。\nWaitComboInput输出SourceStep／RequestId；PlayerCombo拥有段内打断许可与NextStepIndex决策。\n输入Task只提供输入事实，不持有GA打断门。\nCMC的QualifiedMovementIntent提供原Source／Scope的移动资格；Combo持有自己的资格订阅。\n激活重试的请求、许可与等待归ASC；Hero持自身Action观察与输入请求关联。\n[[Input/结构|输入职责]]",
      "x": -300,
      "y": 280,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "combo-s-hit",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## Hero MeleeTrace / Builder / GE / Cue\nHeroCharacter持有MeleeTraceComponent；Combat拥有窗口、采样／去重与Tick。\nTryOpenOwnedTraceWindow／SubscribeWindowHit：服务器窗口请求→原Window句柄及Actor／HitResult事实。\nPlayerCombo持自己的窗口与订阅，负责原激活／段／Task／Window认证及命中响应。\nBuildHitEffectPayload：原命中与所选GE→Context、可选Spec及Cue载荷；伤害结算归GE／Execution／AttributeSet。\nUnsubscribeWindowHit／CloseOwnedTraceWindow：原句柄→只归还对应查询资源。\n[[Combat/结构|查询契约]] · [[GGYGO_流程_伤害结算.canvas|伤害流程]]",
      "x": -260,
      "y": 750,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
